mer warns of insufficient means to evacuate livestock", "url": "https://www.cadena3.com/noticia/noticias-rosario/crecida-del-parana-un-productor-isleno-advirtio-que-faltan-medios-para-evacuar-el-ganado_604327"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T16:30:00Z", "source_name": "clarin.com", "title": "En Santa Fe también esperan la crecida del Paraná y trabajan a contrarreloj para salvar a miles de animales de las islas", "title_en": "In Santa Fe they also await the Paraná flood and work against the clock to save thousands of animals from the islands", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/rural/santa-fe-esperan-crecida-parana-trabajan-contrarreloj-salvar-miles-animales-islas_0_rG19FPTIac.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "corrienteshoy.com", "title": "Alerta roja para Puerto Antequeras, Barranqueras y otras localidades de Chaco", "title_en": "Red alert for Puerto Antequeras, Barranqueras and other localities in Chaco", "url": "https://www.corrienteshoy.com/info-general/alerta-roja-para-puerto-antequeras-barranqueras-y-otras-localidades-de-chaco.htm"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T12:57:52Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Súper Niño 2026 en Argentina, EN VIVO: cuándo llegará el pico de las fuertes lluvias y cómo cambiará el clima en el país", "title_en": "El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: when the peak of heavy rains will arrive and how the climate will change in the country", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/super-nino-2026-argentina-vivo-llegara-pico-fuertes-lluvias-cambiara-clima-pais_0_R3vnElch94.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T06:45:00Z", "source_name": "eldia.com", "title": "¿ Puede pasar en la Región?: alerta por la crecida de los ríos del Litoral", "title_en": "Could it happen in the Region?: alert over flooding of the Litoral rivers", "url": "http://www.eldia.com/la-ciudad/puede-pasar-en-la-region-alerta-por-la-crecida-de-los-rios-del-litoral-la-ciudad_1792385512"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "clarin.com", "title": "Fenómeno El Niño: Corrientes se prepara para la peor semana por la crecida del río Paraná", "title_en": "El Niño phenomenon: Corrientes prepares for worst week due to Paraná River flood", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/fenomeno-nino-corrientes-prepara-peor-semana-crecida-rio-parana_0_vY8xshaK6n.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T11:46:06Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Súper Niño 2026 en Argentina, EN VIVO: qué ciudades están en riesgo de inundación y cuándo llega el pico de la crecida", "title_en": "Super El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: which cities are at risk of flooding and when the flood peak arrives", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/super-nino-2026-argentina-vivo-llegara-pico-fuertes-lluvias-cambiara-clima-pais_0_YXf54Qp9KX.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T17:15:00Z", "source_name": "tn.com.ar", "title": "Alerta ganadera en el Norte: la crecida del río acorrala el pastoreo en Corrientes y Misiones", "title_en": "Livestock alert in the north: river flood corners grazing in Corrientes and Misiones", "url": "https://tn.com.ar/campo/2026/10/19/alerta-ganadera-en-el-norte-la-crecida-del-rio-acorrala-el-pastoreo-en-corrientes-y-misiones/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T22:15:00Z", "source_name": "unosantafe.com.ar", "title": "Crecida del Paraná: Santa Fe prepara un centro de evacuados en Alto Verde con 78 módulos habitacionales", "title_en": "Paraná flood: Santa Fe prepares an evacuee centre in Alto Verde with 78 housing modules", "url": "https://www.unosantafe.com.ar/santa-fe/crecida-del-parana-santa-fe-prepara-un-centro-evacuados-alto-verde-78-modulos-habitacionales-n10287516.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El INA advirtió, a través de su subgerente de Alerta Hidrológico, que el río Paraná se encamina a una crecida significativa que podría llevar su nivel en Santa Fe capital cerca de los cinco metros a fines de octubre, tras las lluvias recientes."}, "summary_en": "The Instituto Nacional del Agua (INA) warned through its hydrological alert subdivision that the Paraná River is heading towards a significant flood, with levels in Santa Fe city possibly approaching five metres in late October, following recent rainfall. The item is a hydrological forecast/alert communication; the snippet does not describe response actions or outcomes.", "title": "The Paraná will have a significant flood and in Santa Fe it could approach five metres", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(18,'flood|NP|gorkha district','flash_flood','2026-10-16T15:42:47Z','2026-10-20T03:07:52Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "PreventionWeb", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [{"code": "NP", "name": "Nepal"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Bhotekoshi, Nepal", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "flood"], "id": 18, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-20T03:07:52Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is an event announcement examining causes, response and lessons of the Bhotekoshi floods, with no specific outcome of warnings reported in the snippet.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:00:00Z", "source_name": "thepeninsulaqatar.com", "title": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future | The Peninsula Qatar", "title_en": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "url": "http://thepeninsulaqatar.com/article/15/10/2026/after-latest-nepal-flood-survivors-fear-for-future"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "surinametimes.com", "title": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "title_en": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "url": "https://www.surinametimes.com/artikel/after-latest-nepal-flood-survivors-fear-for-future"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:47:35Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "The Bhotekoshi flood disaster 2026: Lessons, challenges and the way forward", "title_en": "The Bhotekoshi flood disaster 2026: Lessons, challenges and the way forward", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/event/bhotekoshi-flood-disaster-2026-lessons-challenges-and-way-forward"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A PreventionWeb event will examine the causes, impacts, response and lessons of the 2026 Bhotekoshi floods in Nepal. It aims to identify measures to strengthen disaster preparedness, early warning and emergency response in Nepal and the wider Himalayan region.", "title": "The Bhotekoshi flood disaster 2026: Lessons, challenges and the way forward", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(19,'flood|LK|nilwala river floodplain','flood','2026-10-16T15:42:47Z','2026-10-16T14:50:43Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Flood alert issued for low-lying areas of six Divisional Secretariat divisions"], "agencies": [{"country": "LK", "name": "Irrigation Department", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "LK", "name": "Sri Lanka"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Nilwala River floodplain, Sri Lanka", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 19, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "lead_time": "next 24 hours", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports only a warning of possible minor flooding; no outcome of the warning is given.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:15:00Z", "source_name": "dailymirror.lk", "title": "Nilwala river flood alert: Six divisions at risk - Breaking News", "title_en": "Nilwala river flood alert: Six divisions at risk - Breaking News", "url": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/latest-news/Nilwala-river-flood-alert-Six-divisions-at-risk/342-352605"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Irrigation Department warned that minor flooding is possible in low-lying areas of the Nilwala River floodplain across six Divisional Secretariat divisions within the next 24 hours, following significant rainfall in the upper and middle catchment. The alert concerns forecast and warning of riverine flooding, with no reported impacts or outcomes yet.", "title": "Nilwala river flood alert: Six divisions at risk - Breaking News", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
