esgo de «impactos catastróficos»", "title_en": "Red alert in Valencia and Alicante: affected municipalities, expected rainfall and how long the risk of ''catastrophic impacts'' lasts", "url": "https://www.eldebate.com/espana/comunidad-valenciana/20261017/alerta-roja-valencia-alicante-municipios-afectados-lluvias-previstas-hasta-cuando-hay-riesgo-impactos-catastroficos_470762.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T03:14:37Z", "source_name": "eldebate.com", "title": "Aemet retira la alerta roja en Valencia y Alicante pero avisa de más lluvias de hasta 150 litros para este lunes", "title_en": "Aemet withdraws red alert in Valencia and Alicante but warns of more rain of up to 150 litres for Monday", "url": "https://www.eldebate.com/espana/comunidad-valenciana/20261019/aemet-retira-alerta-roja-valencia-alicante-avisa-lluvias-hasta-150-litros-este-lunes_471072.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Emergencias envió dos mensajes ES-Alert a la población de Valencia y Alicante ante la alerta roja por lluvias, pidiendo evitar desplazamientos, no cruzar zonas inundables, buscar zonas altas y alejarse de la costa."}, "summary_en": "Spain''s emergency services issued two ES-Alert mobile warning messages to residents of Valencia and Alicante in response to a red alert for rain. The messages urged people to avoid travel, stay out of flood-prone areas and river channels, move to higher ground or upper floors, and keep away from the coast. The snippet does not report the outcome of the warnings.", "title": "Emergency services send two ES-Alert messages to the population in Valencia and Alicante over the red rain alert", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(60,'multi_hazard|PE|lima','multi_hazard','2026-10-18T03:11:26Z','2026-10-18T03:08:02Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": ["Enfen maintains El Niño Costero alert", "Senamhi forecasts above-normal river flows", "Cenepred identifies over one million people in very high flash-flood risk zones", "Experts call for reinforced monitoring and prevention"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "Senamhi", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Cenepred", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Enfen", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Lima, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-18T03:08:02Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 60, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-18T03:08:02Z", "lead_time": "from December (approx. 1-2 months ahead)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes forecasts and alerts but reports no realised outcome of the warnings.", "pillars": [1, 2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T21:33:30Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lima frente a El Niño: Rímac, Chillón y Lurín tendrían caudales sobre lo normal desde diciembre", "title_en": "Lima faces El Niño: Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers could have above-normal flows from December", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/10/17/lima-frente-a-el-nino-rimac-chillon-y-lurin-tendrian-caudales-sobre-lo-normal-desde-diciembre-1137249"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Enfen mantiene la alerta por El Niño Costero y el Senamhi prevé caudales superiores a lo habitual en el Rímac, Chillón y Lurín desde diciembre. El Cenepred identifica a más de un millón de personas en zonas de riesgo muy alto por huaico en Lima."}, "summary_en": "Peru''s Enfen maintains an El Niño Costero alert, and Senamhi forecasts above-normal flows in the Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers from December. Cenepred identifies over one million people in very high flash-flood risk zones in Lima department, and specialists call for stronger monitoring and prevention.", "title": "Lima faces El Niño: Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers could have above-normal flows from December", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
